// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_macos_tmutil_disable_backup.yml
// ID Sigma: 2c95fa8a-8b8d-4787-afce-7117ceb8e3da
// Título: Time Machine Backup Disabled Via Tmutil - MacOS
// Descripción: Detects disabling of Time Machine (Apple's automated backup utility software) via the native macOS backup utility "tmutil".
An attacker can use this to prevent backups from occurring.

// Aplica a: Producto: macos | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: macos
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\macos\process_creation\proc_creation_macos_tmutil_disable_backup.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "/tmutil" or ProcessCommandLine contains "tmutil") and ProcessCommandLine contains "disable"
